From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:50:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: add the sg0-pc profile (STEINS;GATE 0 Steam), hidden in
 the launcher

Profile for the Steam release of STEINS;GATE 0: Game.exe next to
USRDIR/*.mpk, movies USRDIR/movie/1920x1080/*.bk2 (name table 0xdcf998).
1920x1080 design size, InstructionSet.SG0, the S;G save protocol through the
MO6TWPC save system (own file format).

Taken from the original data / Game.exe:
- system.mpk sheet ids (table of contents order), font_a.dds 64 x 80 cells of
  48 px, Latin advance widths generated with tools/impacto/sghd/gen_widths.py.
- Message window: MESWIN (0, 882) 1920 x 324 at (0, 756) with the mask (0,
  1212) (0x45fca9); name centred between the two brush strokes of MESWIN
  (1.5 / 169.5, 817.5, 165 x 33) at y 1014 (0x45fd4b / 0x45fda9).
- Title screen: TITLE_CHIP and TITLE_LOGO1..3 positions, timings and hit
  areas from 0x45c1b0 and the routines it calls (see hud/titlemenu.lua). The
  short EXTRA list registers both hit areas at y 519 in the original
  (0x45bcad / 0x45bd7d); the profile uses the drawn position of CLEAR LIST.
  The rotating ornament of the button guide routine (0x456940 type 6) is not
  ported.
- Script variables that differ from S;G, PADcustom 22 (phone: L2 | R2).

Screens not ported yet (save / load, options, backlog, tips, phone / RINE,
extras) reuse sg-pc layouts so that the HUD loads; they are not checked.

TYN only.

Verified on MuMu (Android 15 x86_64 emulator, not a real device), Steam data
with Chinese scripts: title, new game, prologue to SG0_B01_12. Real devices
not tested.

